        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8531TAHA, Hammered Lever with Square Quincy Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose is a stunning example of transitional decore. This beautiful mix of modern and traditional elements makes for a leverset that will look great no matter what. The Hammered Lever with Square Quincy Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from several of the most popular finish choices. The T-Bar Hammered Lever with Quincy Rose will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TAHA-specifications.gif?v=1704354593\" width=\"600\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Hammered Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Hammered T-Bar Door Lever with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the T-Bar Hammered Lever with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TAHA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262372\"><b>Emtek Hammered Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hammered T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose",
                "description": "The Hammered T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Rose is a stunning example of transitional decore. This beautiful mix of modern and traditional elements makes for a leverset that will look great no matter what. The Hammered Lever with Square Quincy Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from several of the most popular finish choices. The T-Bar Hammered Lever with Quincy Rose will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Hammered Lever with Square Quincy Rosettes, T-Bar Hammered Lever with Quincy Roses, Hammered T-Bar Leverset with Quincy Roses, Emtek 8531TAHA, EMT-8531TAHA, Emtek Select Brass leversets, Hammered T-Bar Door Lever with Quincy Roses, transitional levers,"
